"The assistant is an AI, not a person, and it can make mistakes: check its "
"answers and its changes before you rely on them. What you write and what it "
"reads in the panel (logs, settings, code) is sent to %(provider)s, the "
"provider of your panel's AI key, under your organisation's contract with it."
" Actions that delete data, deploy to production or change sensitive settings"
" wait for your confirmation. Only you can see your conversations, and each "
"one is deleted 30 days after its last activity."
msgstr ""
"El asistente es una IA, no una persona, y puede equivocarse: revise sus "
"respuestas y sus cambios antes de darlos por buenos. Lo que usted escribe y "
